# Teman UMKM Kita — Project Rules

Baca juga: [CLAUDE.md](./CLAUDE.md)

## Git
- Feature branch: `feat/`, `fix/`, `chore/` + kebab-case — jangan commit langsung ke `main`
- Conventional Commits
- Merge ke `main` = auto-deploy Vercel
- Hapus branch setelah merge

## Stack
- Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript 5 strict, Tailwind CSS 3, Framer Motion
- Backend: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0, bcrypt (NOT passlib), JWT
- DB: MySQL, hosting: Vercel + LiteSpeed Passenger

## Never
- JANGAN pakai `passlib` — pakai `bcrypt>=4.0`
- JANGAN commit `.env`
